{"result":"{
  "id": "19212",
  "key": "SFCC-749",
  "summary": "Disclaimer – PWA Kit Component",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/19212",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, **I want** to see relevant disclaimer text on applicable pages, **so that** I am informed of any terms or conditions relevant to my browsing context\n\nThis is a **PWA Kit component story**. It covers the build of the Disclaimer React component in the PWA Kit storefront. The Disclaimer component is separate from the Footer component and renders above it on relevant pages. It consumes content managed in Contentful — see companion Contentful story [SFCC-749](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-749) \n\nBased on the Figma design the component displays three elements: a left-aligned title (e.g. TERMS AND CONDITIONS), a body text paragraph, and a READ MORE link. All content is driven by Contentful and is not hardcoded in the component.\n\nThe following are explicitly out of scope: the Footer component (separate story), and hover/focus/active visual states (defined in UI kit).\n\n**UI Design Kit:** [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=2083-54022&p=f&t=8DrHJtkYe3Taw9hz-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026) \n\n![\"image-20260817-002936.png\"](image-20260817-002936.png)",
  "status": {
    "name": "In Refinement",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
